{"title":"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 21","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>A positive integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/2/302e99c1c7cd91a6ae371139e5142ccef5977dca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> divisors and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/9/40905e7046ff302141d715350424107af2ee3d67.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7n$\" width=\"19\" height=\"12\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea5fcc6d66685ee21f722efcd228eb44d38f262.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> divisors.  What is the greatest integer <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/9/c/d9c75b34bd42bc8596daa00e3f6ddd040a47b4ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7^k$\" width=\"16\" height=\"15\" /> divides <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/e/dfefd79e7487ad48a38f35d46ed92443682844a5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ {{{0}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(B)}\\ {{{1}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(C)}\\ {{{2}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(D)}\\ {{{3}}} \\qquad \\mathrm{(E)}\\ {{{4}}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"342\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We may let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/9/9c9063417e2ec0261aa4fa97a9ce5ea4e1c38df3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n = 7^k \\cdot m$\" width=\"81\" height=\"15\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> is not divisible by 7. Using the fact that the number of divisors function <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/0/5/b05725a6508fe8df761c6e91d2735b697ebd87d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(n)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"33\" height=\"18\" /> is multiplicative, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/7/b/57b681a19173b376fe8da9375d10e8490158b44b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(n) = d(7^k)d(m) = (k+1)d(m) = 60$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"300\" height=\"20\" />. Also, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/a/2/7a23779ca7dfe362ae2b35bd86ffdb792398779e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d(7n) = d(7^{k+1})d(m) = (k+2)d(m) = 80$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"326\" height=\"20\" />. These numbers are in the ratio 3:4, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/6/5065beb39669decdc0d8b17bf7d1fe67f0e4692c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{k+1}{k+2} = \\frac{3}{4} \\implies k = 2 \\Rightarrow \\boxed{\\mathrm{C}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -14px\" width=\"228\" height=\"39\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_21&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B\">2005 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_20\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 20\">Problem 20</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 22\">Problem 22</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"2\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2005_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2005 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a 